# 💻 Data Structures & Algorithms Lab (in C)

A comprehensive collection of Data Structures and Algorithms implemented in C. This repository contains my lab assignments, practice codes, and algorithmic problem-solving for the B.Tech CSE (Cybersecurity) curriculum at Adamas University.

## 🎯 Objective
To build a strong foundation in computational thinking by implementing core data structures from scratch and understanding how memory is managed at a low level using C.

## 🗂️ Repository Structure

*   **`Arrays/`** - Searching (Linear, Binary), Sorting (Bubble, Selection, Insertion), and matrix operations.
*   **`Linked_Lists/`** - Singly, Doubly, and Circular linked list operations (insertion, deletion, traversal).
*   **`Stacks/`** - Array and Linked List implementations, infix to postfix conversion, parenthesis balancing.
*   **`Queues/`** - Linear Queue, Circular Queue, and Priority Queue implementations.
*   **`Trees/`** - Binary Search Tree (BST) operations, traversals (Inorder, Preorder, Postorder).
*   **`Graphs/`** - BFS and DFS traversals, adjacency matrix/list representations.

